   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **intro music**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **Run Through**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n- **Northern Sky**: rare: 3 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2005-10-10** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 103 min; rated 3.67/5 by 3 [1]. Said about its sound: Recording is a good audience recording, better than the NPR webcast source; Sound quality is acceptable for an audience tape, though it has too much bass [2][3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Kathleen Edwards provided vocals for this specific song during the performance [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2005-10-10**: taped by Kyle Pike; source: Microtech Gefell M300 > Digimod UA-5 > JB3 [1]. Also: The concert was broadcast and webcast on NPR [1]",
